  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Human Edge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mentoring is a central aspect of the Orange Corners programme and high-quality mentorship is crucial for effective entrepreneurship support. As the programme operates across 20 countries in Africa, the Middle East and Bangladesh with a decentralized approach, local implementing partners (OC hubs) have significant freedom to design their mentorship components. The lack of a consistent mentorship framework leads to uneven quality across OC hubs. This project maps and assesses current mentorship approaches to be able to build a mentoring capacity strengthening project in a follow-up project.  A specialised implementing partner will investigate interest among OC hubs and execute audits to get insight into their mentoring needs.</narrative>
  </description>
